-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",93,{
[2945]="7006F2A9\n1\tFollow the escaping Utûgi north-west to the Hill of the Mother\tThe Utûgi escaped to the north-west. That way lies the Hill of the Mother!\n2\tExamine the corpse of the dead Utûgi warrior\tOne of the Utûgi succumbed to its wounds not far from the Hill of the Mother.\n3\tTalk to Irsinith on the other side of Amûma at the Hill of the Mother\tIrsinith may have seen what befell the Utûgi raiding-party as it approached the Hill of the Mother.\n4\tFind the fleeing Utûgi warriors near Laivárth\tThe remaining Utûgi warriors escaped to the north-west, heading for the grove of Laivárth.\n5\tExamine the corpse outside Laivárth... and survive\tThe other Utûgi warriors perished outside the grove of Laivárth.\n6\tTalk to Shadalith in Laivárth\tSince you have returned to the grove of Laivárth, you should speak to Shadalith and see if everything is all right.\n7\tExamine Shadalith's bucket in Laivárth\tShadalith wanted you to see what happened to her bucket in Laivárth.\n8\tTalk to Shadalith in Laivárth\tShadalith is in the grove of Laivárth.\n9\tTalk to Inkanûsh in Sul Madásh\tInkanûsh is waiting in Sul Madásh for you to return with news of the raiding-party of Utûgi.\n",
[2946]="70053A36\n1\tTalk to Ayorzén at the Eagle and Star\tAyorzén is at the Eagle and Star in Minas Tirith.\n2\tTalk to Beregond in Echad Uial\tBeregond is at Echad Uial, in Imlad Morgul.\n3\tTalk to Ayorzén at Echad Uial\tAyorzén has come to Echad Uial, in Imlad Morgul.\n4\tTalk to Mithrandir in Echad Uial\tMithrandir has returned to Echad Uial, in Imlad Morgul.\n5\tDefeat Orcs in Minas Morgul (total: 4)\030Defeat the Dead in Minas Morgul (total: 4)\030Defeat merrevail in Minas Morgul (total: 4)\tOrcs and other foes remain a danger within Minas Morgul, and you should thin their numbers before setting Mithrandir's plan into motion.\n6\tTalk to Culang on the uppermost tier of Minas Morgul\tCulang is standing watch near the entrance to Barad Cúron on the uppermost tier of Minas Morgul.\n7\tTalk to Ayorzén on the uppermost tier of Minas Morgul\tAyorzén is on the uppermost tier of Minas Morgul.\n",
[2947]="7006E4B4\n1\tTalk to Tasâdi at the Waterway Market\tTasâdi usually holds court at the Waterway Market to the south-east of Dâr Laja.\n2\tStand by the small knot of people to the south of Tasâdi and listen to their conversation\tA small knot of people to the south of Tasâdi seem to be discussing what they have heard. You should listen to their conversation.\n3\tTalk to Phârex at the Waterway Market\tPhârex has caught your eye.\n4\tStand by the small group of people to the south past the fountain and listen to their conversation\tSome folk just past the fountain south of Phârex are discussing the effect a Wizard could have on the political situation of Umbar Baharbêl. You should listen to their conversation.\n5\tTalk to Ushrin at the Waterway Market\tUshrin has his own opinions concerning the effect of a Wizard on these lands.\n6\tStand by the small group of people to the south of Ushrin and listen to their conversation\tA small knot of people to the south of Ushrin loudly discuss the rumours concerning a Wizard's powers. You should listen to their conversation.\n7\tTalk to Inkanûsh beside the Fathomwell beyond the archway\tDespite the claims of the Umbari that they would know the Wizard when he entered the city, just such a person has already arrived.\n",
[2948]="70053A37\n1\tTalk to Ayorzén on the uppermost tier of Minas Morgul and complete 'Instance: Gothmog's Rage'\tAyorzén is on the uppermost tier of Minas Morgul, willing to help you gain access to the Tower of the Crescent Moon.\n2\tTalk to the shade of Isildur in Barad Cúron\tThe nearby presence of Isildur's bones has allowed his shade to assume physical form in Barad Cúron.\n",
[2949]="7006E4BA\n1\tTalk to Inkanûsh beside the Fathomwell and go with him to investigate the nearby commotion\tThe Wizard Inkanûsh wishes to go with you to investigate the nearby commotion. Speak with him beside the Fathomwell on the eastern side of the city.\n2\tTalk to Inkanûsh by the stable-master at the Fleet-gate\tInkanûsh stands by the stable-master at the Fleet-gate in south-eastern Umbar Baharbêl.\n",
[2950]="70053A38\n1\tFind the room of the beacon in Barad Cúron\tThe shade of Isildur believes his bones can be found in the room beneath the beacon atop Barad Cúron.\n2\tExamine the Oath-stone of Dúath\030Defeat invading merrevail in the room of the Oath-stone (total: 4)\tThe shade of Isildur believes his bones can be found in the room beneath the beacon atop Barad Cúron.\n3\tFind the casket containing Isildur's bones\tThe shade of Isildur believes his bones can be found in the room beneath the beacon atop Barad Cúron.\n4\tBring the casket of dust to the throne room in Barad Cúron\tThe shade of Isildur waits for you to bring the casket containing his bones to the throne room in the tower.\n5\tTalk to the shade of Isildur in the throne room of Barad Cúron\tThe shade of Isildur waits in the throne room of Barad Cúron.\n6\tTalk to Gothmog in the throne room of Barad Cúron\tGothmog slumps against the wall in the throne room of Barad Cúron.\n",
[2951]="7006E4BD\n1\tTalk to Shâra Mizâdi at the town of Urmâkh in Imhûlar\tShâra Mizâdi intends to rejoin her army near the town of Urmâkh in Imhûlar, and Inkanûsh asked you to speak with her there about her plans.\n2\tStand by the eastern gate of Urmâkh and look for Mizâdi's returning soldiers\tShâra Mizâdi invited you to stand by the eastern gate of Urmâkh and look for her returning soldiers.\n3\tSoldiers that fought for Mizâdi at Kûr Anzar slowly climb the road to Urmâkh.\t\n4\tTalk to Glorfindel inside the eastern gate of Urmâkh\tGlorfindel has arrived at Urmâkh, and wishes to speak with you about the next leg of your journey.\n5\tTalk to Thórvilon at Vartúlin, south-east of Urmâkh\tThe Kinta Thórvilon tends the grove of Vartúlin, to the south-east of Urmâkh.\n6\tTalk to Inkanûsh at the Kinta grove of Vartúlin in Imhûlar\tInkanûsh has come to the Kinta grove of Vartúlin in Imhûlar.\n7\tSearch for some sign of the Utûgi to the north or north-east of Vartúlin\tInkanûsh fears that the Utûgi have drawn near to the grove of Vartúlin, and he wants you to search the dead woods nearby for some sign of their presence.\n8\tHostile eyes study you from nearby. You need to draw this foe out of hiding!\t\n9\tTalk to Inkanûsh at the Kinta grove of Vartúlin in Imhûlar\tInkanûsh waits for the report of your scouting at the Kinta grove of Vartúlin in Imhûlar.\n",
[2952]="70053A39\n1\tTalk to Culang in the throne room of Barad Cúron\tCulang is in the throne room of Barad Cúron.\n2\tTalk to Culang in the throne room and complete 'Instance: A Vengeful Heart'\tCulang is in the throne room of Barad Cúron, concerned about the sound of newcomers approaching.\n3\tTalk to Culang in the throne room of Barad Cúron\tCulang is in the throne room of Barad Cúron.\n",
[2953]="7006E4C0\n1\tTalk to Inkanûsh at Vartúlin and go with him to speak with Cúridwan\tInkanûsh waits at Vartúlin for you and Glorfindel to go with him to speak with Cúridwan.\n2\tTalk to Inkanûsh at Vartúlin\tInkanûsh has returned to the Kinta grove of Vartúlin in Imhûlar and wishes to speak with you.\n",
[2954]="70053A3A\n1\tTalk to Gothmog in the throne room of Barad Cúron\tGothmog is in the throne room of Barad Cúron, trying to speak despite his wounds.\n2\tTalk to the shade of Isildur in the throne room of Barad Cúron\tThe shade of Isildur is in the throne room of Barad Cúron.\n3\tPick up the casket of dust in the throne room\tThe shade of Isildur has asked you to bring the casket containing the dust of his bones out of Barad Cúron.\n4\tMeet up with Ayorzén outside Barad Cúron, on the uppermost tier of Minas Morgul\tAyorzén is waiting for you on the uppermost tier of Minas Morgul.\n5\tLook for Ayorzén at Echad Uial\tYou did not find Ayorzén at the meeting-place, and should look for him at Echad Uial.\n6\tTalk to Mithrandir at Echad Uial\tMithrandir is at Echad Uial.\n7\tTalk to Faramir at Echad Uial\tPrince Faramir is at Echad Uial.\n8\tBring the casket of dust and the broken key to Mithrandir at Echad Uial\tMithrandir is at Echad Uial.\n",
[2955]="7006F2A2\n1\tTalk to Thórvilon\tThórvilon is at the Kinta grove of Vartúlin, in Imhûlar.\n2\tTalk to Athgai at the border with Adagím\tAthgai stands at the border with Adagím.\n3\tDefeat Orcs from Mauthark or Mokh Grazádh in Adagím (total: 8)\tMauthark and Mokh Grazádh can be found among the swamps of Adagím.\n4\tFind the grove of Laivárth in Adagím\tAthgai told you to seek the grove of Laivárth, north-east along the path in Adagím.\n5\tTalk to Glorfindel in Laivárth\tGlorfindel stands in the grove of Laivárth.\n6\tTalk to Shadalith in Laivárth\tShadalith stands nearby in the grove of Laivárth.\n7\tCollect sample of the rot north-east of Laivárth\030Collect sample of the rot north-west of Laivárth\030Collect sample of the rot west of Laivárth\tShadalith asked you to retrieve samples of the rot at locations to the north-east, north-west, and west of Laivárth.\n8\tTalk to Shadalith in Laivárth\tShadalith is at the grove of Laivárth.\n9\tAdd the blight samples to the water bucket in Laivárth\tShadalith placed a bucket of water to the west. She wants you to add the samples of the blight you collected to the water so she can see if there is any effect.\n10\tTalk to Shadalith in Laivárth\tShadalith is in Laivárth.\n",
[2956]="7006F2A3\n1\tFind Tûl Ama to the south-east of Laivárth\tTûl Ama, the Hill of the Mother, is to the south-east of Laivárth.\n2\tTalk to Glorfindel at Tûl Ama\tGlorfindel stands sorrowfully by Amûma, the Old Mother of Adagím.\n3\tTalk to Irsinith at the Hill of the Mother\tIrsinith is at Tûl Ama, the Hill of the Mother.\n4\tCollect venom sacs from spiders in Adagím (total: 6)\030Collect sickly wings from sickle-flies in Adagím (total: 4)\030Collect damaged leaves from Huorns in Adagím (total: 2)\tIrsinith asked you to collect venom-sacs, sickly wings, and damaged leaves from creatures located not far from the Hill of the Mother in Adagím.\n5\tBring the venom sacs, wings, and leaves to Irsinith at the Hill of the Mother\tIrsinith is at the Hill of the Mother in Adagím.\n6\tTalk to Glorfindel at the Hill of the Mother\tGlorfindel is at the Hill of the Mother in Adagím.\n",
[2957]="7006F2A4\n1\tTravel to the southern entrance of Sul Madásh\tSul Madásh lies to the south-east of the Hill of the Mother, in Adagím.\n2\tTalk to Baharúd at the southern entrance to Sul Madásh\tThe Kinta guardsman Baharúd stands at the southern entrance to Sul Madásh.\n3\tTalk to Inkanûsh at the southern entrance to Sul Madásh\tInkanûsh stands at the southern entrance to Sul Madásh.\n4\tTalk to a Kinta of Sul Madásh north-east of the entrance\tKintai within the grove of Sul Madásh may know of recent visitors.\n5\tTalk to another Kinta of Sul Madásh further into the grove\tKintai within the grove of Sul Madásh may know of recent visitors.\n6\tFind Ulishár to the east\tKintai within Sul Madásh told you that the Kinta Ulishár might know of Cúridwan's whereabouts.\n7\tTalk to Corudan in Sul Madásh\tCorudan stands in the centre of Sul Madásh.\n8\tTalk to Ulishár in Sul Madásh\tThe Kinta Ulishár has overheard your conversation and might have some advice for you.\n",
[2958]="7006F2A5\n1\tTalk to Baharúd at the entrance to Sul Madásh\tBaharúd is at the southern entrance to Sul Madásh.\n2\tLook for Cúridwan\030Travel south-east of Sul Madásh through the swamp-land\tBaharúd agreed to travel south-east of Sul Madásh and to look with you for Cúridwan.\n3\tTalk to Baharúd in the swamps south-east of Sul Madásh\tBaharúd is in the swamps south-east of Sul Madásh in Adagím.\n4\tTravel west through the swamps to continue your search for Cúridwan\tBaharúd suggested that you travel west through the swamps to continue your search.\n5\tTalk to Baharúd in the swamps west of Sul Madásh\tBaharúd is in the swamps west of Sul Madásh, in Adagím.\n6\tTravel south-west to the Elderwell in search of Cúridwan\tYour search for Cúridwan now leads south-west to the Elderwell.\n7\tTalk to Cúridwan at the Elderwell\tCúridwan is at the Elderwell in Adagím.\n8\tCollect crocodile teeth north-west of the Elderwell (total: 4)\030Collect samples from blight pustules north-west of the Elderwell (total: 3)\tCúridwan asked you to collect crocodile teeth and samples of the blight north-west of the Elderwell.\n9\tBring the crocodile teeth and blight samples to Cúridwan at the Elderwell\tCúridwan is waiting at the Elderwell for you to return with the things she requested.\n10\tTalk to Baharúd at the Elderwell\tBaharúd is at the Elderwell in Adagím.\n11\tReturn to Sul Madásh and look for Cúridwan\tBaharúd believes that Cúridwan may have gone to Sul Madásh. You hope he is right!\n12\tTalk to Sigileth in Sul Madásh\tSigileth has finished speaking with the elders of Sul Madásh.\n",
[2959]="7006F2A7\n1\tTalk to Inkanûsh in Sul Madásh\tInkanûsh is in Sul Madásh.\n2\tTalk to Inkanûsh in Sul Madásh and go with him to speak to Cúridwan\tInkanûsh is in Sul Madásh and ready to speak to Cúridwan.\n3\tTalk to Ulishár in Sul Madásh\tThe Utûgi have been driven away from Sul Madásh, but they leave sorrow in their wake.\n4\tTalk to Sigileth in Sul Madásh\tThe Utûgi have been driven away from Sul Madásh, but they leave sorrow in their wake.\n5\tHer words hang on the air\tThe Utûgi have been driven away from Sul Madásh, but they leave sorrow in their wake.\n6\tTalk to Cúridwan in Sul Madásh and ask that she explain herself\tCúridwan stands in Sul Madásh.\n",
[2960]="7001B77D\n1\tTalk to Ellunen at Thangúlhad\tEllunen is in Thangúlhad, preparing for its defence. Ningloril has asked you to come to the defence of Thangúlhad and directed you to speak with Ellunen.\n2\tComplete Skirmish: Protectors of Thangúlhad\tEllunen is waiting for you to participate in the defence of Thangúlhad. This quest involves a Skirmish that can be completed at Solo, Duo, Small Fellowship, Fellowship, or Raid group sizes by using the Skirmish Join Panel. This Skirmish has a minimum level of 60.\n3\tTalk to Ellunen at Thangúlhad\tEllunen is at Thangúlhad, the camp of the Golden Host in Gathbúrz. You have helped defend Thangúlhad and should report now to Ellunen.\n",
[2961]="70021E93\n1\tExplore the dwarf-hall in Thrór's Coomb\tThe dwarf-hall is located among the northern mountains of Thrór's Coomb, far to the east of Lhanuch, the Uch-lûth village in Nan Laeglin. Nona has asked you to journey to the dwarf-hall in Thrór's Coomb to learn what Wadu saw there that brought him to Fordirith and then to his death.\n2\tTalk to Frithgeir at Zudrugund\tTwo dwarves make their home in Zudrugund, the dwarf-hall in Thrór's Coomb, within Nár's Peak. One of the dwarves in the hall seems unable to focus upon you, but the other may be able to tell you what is going on.\n3\tCollect handfuls of Hulwul-harâz (total: 6)\030Collect Najâm-mujdu flowers (total: 6)\030Collect Kibil-lawâz (total: 4)\tThe ingredients needed by Frithgeir to make the brew can be found throughout Thrór's Coomb. He gave you a list of the ingredients and their locations to study. Frithgeir can make a brew that brings Nár back to awareness.\n4\tBring the list and ingredients to Frithgeir\tFrithgeir is in Zudrugund, the once-abandoned dwarf-hall in Thrór's Coomb. You have collected the ingredients needed by Frithgeir to make the brew that will restore Nár's awareness of his surroundings.\n",
[2962]="7006F2CE\n1\tTravel north-east of Zajâna on the road to An Shêru\tThe road to An Shêru runs by Zajâna. You should begin by going to the north-east.\n2\tSomething strikes you as suspicious about the signpost north-east of Zajâna.\t\n3\tRepair the brigand-tampered signpost\tIf Dagûrum had allies, leaving the signpost as it is may help them ambush other travellers. You should repair the signpost and ruin their plans.\n4\tContinue further north-west along the road to An Shêru\tThe road to An Shêru leads north-west of Zajâna.\n5\tBrigands may have tampered with the signpost north of Zajâna as well.\t\n6\tRepair the brigand-tampered signpost north of Zajâna\tYou should repair this signpost north of Zajâna as you repaired the other.\n7\tTalk to Rahâzi north of Zajâna\tRahâzi has arrived in the company of two Hamâti soldiers.\n8\tCollect blades from brigands in Kighân (total: 6)\030Collect bows from the Hold of Jalkhíla (total: 2)\tThe Hold of Jalkhíla is located to the east in Kighân.\n9\tBring the blades and bows to Rahâzi at Gadim-ûn in An Shêru\tRahâzi asked you to meet up with her party at Gadim-ûn in An Shêru.\n",
[2963]="7006F2AA\n1\tTalk to Ulishár in Sul Madásh\tUlishár is by the southern entrance to Sul Madásh.\n2\tTalk to Corudan in Sul Madásh\tCorudan is by the southern entrance to Sul Madásh.\n3\tWait for Corudan to depart\tCorudan has regretfully decided he cannot accompany you.\n4\tTalk to Ulishár in Sul Madásh\tUlishár has joined your travelling companions for the journey south.\n5\tFind the entrance to Kighân, south-west of Sul Madásh\tUlishár agreed to show you where the road passes from Adagím into Kighân, south-west of Sul Madásh.\n6\tTalk to Ulishár on the road into Kighân\tUlishár stands where the road leads south-west into Kighân.\n",
[2964]="7006F2B9\n1\tTravel to Shádhag in Kighân\tThe trees at Shádhag may have been corrupted by the blight creeping into Kighân from Adagím.\n2\tCollect unblighted seed-pods from trees at Shádhag (total: 4)\030Defeat fungal roots at Shádhag (total: 6)\tUlishár asked you to collect unblighted seed-pods from trees and defeat their corrupted roots at Shádhag, in Kighân.\n3\tBring the seed-pods to Ulishár at the village of Sormedân, to the south\tUlishár said he would wait for you at the village of Sormedân, to the south.\n4\tTalk to Glorfindel at Sormedân\tGlorfindel is at the village of Sormedân.\n5\tTalk to Inkanûsh at Sormedân\tInkanûsh is at the village of Sormedân.\n6\tTalk to Khâwaz at Sormedân\tKhâwaz at the village of Sormedân is reluctant to speak to you, but might be convinced.\n7\tReassure villagers of Sormedân (0/2)\tVillagers of Sormedân are frightened of Glorfindel, and need reassurance that he is a friend and can be trusted.\n8\tReassure villagers of Sormedân (1/2)\tVillagers of Sormedân are frightened of Glorfindel, and need reassurance that he is a friend and can be trusted.\n9\tTalk to Khâwaz at Sormedân\tKhâwaz at the village of Sormedân has something to say to you.\n",
[2965]="7006F2BA\n1\tLook for Rôkhasar near Badrasâg to the south-east of Sormedân\tKhâwaz fears that Rôkhasar may have strayed too near Badrasâg, the Blade-horn south-east of Sormedân, in pursuit of his cattle.\n2\tDefeat spirits at Badrasâg ([see journal]/5)\tThe spirits at Badrasâg should be defeated to ensure the safety of Sormedân.\n3\tDefeat spirits at Badrasâg (4/5)\tThe spirits at Badrasâg should be defeated to ensure the safety of Sormedân.\n4\tTalk to Rôkhasar below the Blade-horn\tYou heard someone calling for you below the Blade-horn. Could it be the missing farmer Rôkhasar?\n5\tConsider how Mizâdi will react to this situation\tYou consider how Mizâdi will react to this situation.\n6\tTalk to Rôkhasar below the Blade-horn\tRôkhasar is below the Blade-horn, in Kighân.\n7\tFind Mizâdi at Ingar-garâsh in the southern reaches of Kighân\tMizâdi will be at Ingar-garâsh to the south-west, deep within Kighân.\n8\tTalk to Mizâdi at Ingar-garâsh in southern Kighân\tMizâdi stands at Ingar-garâsh in southern Kighân.\n9\tTalk to Rahâzi at Ingar-garâsh\tRahâzi stands at Ingar-garâsh in southern Kighân.\n",
[2966]="7006F2BB\n1\tTalk to Mizâdi at Ingar-garâsh\tMizâdi stands at Ingar-garâsh in southern Kighân.\n2\tTalk to Rahâzi at Ingar-garâsh\tRahâzi is at Ingar-garâsh in southern Kighân.\n3\tCollect eggs from nests at Khatzâla east of Ingar-garâsh (total: 4)\030Collect meat from creatures in Kighân (total: 12)\tMizâdi has charged you with the tasks her soldiers would have accomplished if they did not now need to provide aid and recompense to the farmers of Sormedân. These tasks include collecting eggs from nests at Khatzâla and collecting meat from creatures throughout Kighân.\n4\tBring the meat and eggs you collected to Dunaïl at Ingar-garâsh\tThe provisioner Dunaïl stands at Ingar-garâsh.\n5\tTalk to Mizâdi at Ingar-garâsh\tMizâdi is at Ingar-garâsh in southern Kighân.\n6\tTalk to Rahâzi at Ingar-garâsh\tRahâzi is at Ingar-garâsh in southern Kighân.\n",
[2967]="7006F2BC\n1\tTalk to Ulishár at Ingar-garâsh\tUlishár has come to Ingar-garâsh in southern Kighân.\n2\tMeet up with Ulishár at the cross-road north-west of Ingar-garâsh\tUlishár suggested that you travel to the cross-road north-west of the war-camp.\n3\tTalk to Ulishár at the cross-road north-west of Ingar-garâsh\tUlishár stands beside the road that leads south-west to Zajâna.\n4\tTravel to Khab Antâx, the Overgate outside Zajâna\tUlishár suggested that you continue to the south-west until you reach Khab Antâx, the Overgate outside Zajâna.\n5\tTalk to Ulishár at Khab Antâx, the Overgate outside Zajâna\tUlishár stands by Khab Antâx, the Overgate outside Zajâna.\n6\tContinue on into Zajâna and meet up with Ulishár\tUlishár suggested that you continue on into Zajâna itself.\n7\tTalk to Ulishár inside Zajâna\tUlishár is inside the city of Zajâna.\n",
[2968]="7006F2BE\n1\tLook at the commons to learn the layout of the city\030Climb the stairs west to the commons of Zajâna\tUlishár suggested that you climb the stairs to the west and look at the commons of the city, so you might learn the layout of Zajâna.\n2\tLook at the stage in the scholar's district\030Walk north into the scholar's district and find the stage\tNorth of the commons lies the scholar's district of the city. Ulishár recommended that you go there and look at the various sights of Zajâna.\n3\tTalk to Glorfindel by the stage in north-west Zajâna\tGlorfindel is by the stage in north-western Zajâna.\n4\tFind Inkanûsh at Khab Kitâx, the Nethergate south of Zajâna\tGlorfindel told you that Inkanûsh went to inspect Khab Kitâx, the Nethergate south of Zajâna.\n5\tTalk to Inkanûsh at Khab Kitâx, the Nethergate\tInkanûsh is at Khab Kitâx, the Nethergate south of Zajâna.\n6\tTalk to Ulishár at Khab Kitâx, the Nethergate\tUlishár is at Khab Kitâx, the Nethergate, and is very interested in something you have said.\n",
[2969]="7006F2C0\n1\tTalk to Inkanûsh at the Nethergate\tInkanûsh is at the Nethergate south of Zajâna.\n2\tTalk to Inkanûsh when you are ready to find the theatre troupe\tInkanûsh is at the Nethergate south of Zajâna.\n3\tTalk to Ulishár by the stage in Zajâna\tUlishár is by the stage in Zajâna.\n",
[2970]="7006F2C6\n1\tFind Têrkar's Travellers at the western market in Zajâna\tTêrkar's Travellers may be in the western market of Zajâna.\n2\tTalk to Ulishár at the western market in Zajâna\tUlishár is at the western market in Zajâna.\n3\tTalk to Satagêra in Zajâna\tThe playwright Satagêra is at the western market in Zajâna.\n4\tTalk to Imalêkh in Zajâna\030Talk to Jêsamin in Zajâna\030Talk to Mashkânu in Zajâna\030Talk to Atâlsi in Zajâna\tTêrkar's Travellers are at the western market in Zajâna.\n5\tTalk to Ulishár at the western market in Zajâna\tUlishár is at the western market in Zajâna.\n6\tTalk to Satagêra in Zajâna\tThe playwright Satagêra is at the western market in Zajâna.\n7\tFind Asharmûl and Zimêlkha in the residential district of Zajâna to the south-east\tAsharmûl and Zimêlkha went to the residential district of south-east Zajâna.\n8\tTalk to Zimêlkha in south-east Zajâna\tZimêlkha is outside the Ordâkh-controlled district in south-east Zajâna.\n9\tTalk to Asharmûl in south-east Zajâna\tAsharmûl is outside the Ordâkh-controlled district in south-east Zajâna.\n10\tRetrieve the coin-purse from the Ordâkh-controlled district\tAsharmûl and Zimêlkha asked you to retrieve from the Ordâkhai the coin-purse containing the money Têrkar's Travellers earned from their performance.\n11\tBring the empty coin-purse to Asharmûl in south-east Zajâna\tThe coin-purse you were sent to retrieve has been emptied of its contents by the Ordâkhai, but you should return it to Asharmûl in south-east Zajâna.\n12\tBring the heavy coin-purse to Atâlsi at the western market in Zajâna\tAtâlsi is at the western market in Zajâna.\n13\tTalk to Glorfindel at the western market in Zajâna\tGlorfindel is at the western market in Zajâna.\n",
[2971]="7006F2CD\n1\tTalk to Inkanûsh in the Kalmakhíla in north-west Zajâna\tInkanûsh is in the Kalmakhíla in north-west Zajâna, beside the commons.\n2\tRead the open book on the table in the Kalmakhíla\tInkanûsh has selected a tome and some pages for you to study in the Kalmakhíla.\n3\tRead the pages on the table in the Kalmakhíla\tInkanûsh has selected a tome and some pages for you to study in the Kalmakhíla.\n4\tTalk to Inkanûsh in the Kalmakhíla\tInkanûsh is in the Kalmakhíla in Zajâna.\n5\tSomeone approaches, and their anger is evident\tSomeone approaches, and they sound angry.\n6\tTalk to Mashkânu in the Kalmakhíla\tMashkânu of Têrkar's Travellers has come to the Kalmakhíla, his weapon raised in anger.\n7\tCalm Mashkânu in the Kalmakhíla\tIf you are able to calm Mashkânu, you might avoid the violence he intends in the Kalmakhíla.\n8\tRemain on guard, just in case\tHave your efforts borne fruit?\n9\tRemain on guard, just in case\tHave your efforts borne fruit?\n10\tTalk to Mashkânu in the Kalmakhíla\tMashkânu's rage has been replaced with sorrow.\n11\tTalk to Inkanûsh in the Kalmakhíla\tInkanûsh stands in the Kalmakhíla.\n12\tTalk to Mashkânu in the Kalmakhíla\tMashkânu's rage has been replaced with sorrow.\n13\tTalk to Inkanûsh in the Kalmakhíla\tInkanûsh stands in the Kalmakhíla.\n14\tFind Glorfindel at the Overgate outside Zajâna\tGlorfindel is at the Overgate north of Zajâna.\n15\tTalk to Glorfindel at the Overgate\tGlorfindel is at the Overgate outside Zajâna.\n16\tTalk to Ulishár at the Overgate\tUlishár is at the Overgate outside Zajâna.\n",
[2972]="70021E94\n1\tTalk to Frithgeir and wait for him to make the brew for Nár\tFrithgeir is in Zudrugund, the once-abandoned dwarf-hall in Thrór's Coomb. Frithgeir is preparing to make the brew that will restore Nár's clarity so you can ask him questions.\n2\tTalk to Frithgeir at Zudrugund\tFrithgeir is in Zudrugund, the once-abandoned dwarf-hall in Thrór's Coomb. You have travelled with Nár into the mine beneath Zudrugund and witnessed some peculiar things that the Dúnedain are hard-pressed to explain.\n3\tTalk to Corunir in Zudrugund\tCorunir is at Zudrugund. Frithgeir wants you to speak to Corunir and assure him that Nár means no harm.\n",
[2973]="7001B5C8\n1\tTalk to Goldagnir at Thangúlhad\tGoldagnir is in Thangúlhad. You have been told to speak with Goldagnir about the details of the plan to strike the fortress of Dol Guldur.\n2\tComplete Skirmish: Breaching the Necromancer's Gate\tThe time has come to launch the strike against Dol Guldur. The first skirmish will take place at the gate of the fortress. This quest involves a Skirmish that can be completed at Solo, Duo, Small Fellowship, Fellowship, or Raid group sizes by using the Skirmish Join Panel. This Skirmish has a minimum level of 60.\n3\tTalk to Goldagnir at Thangúlhad\tGoldagnir is in Thangúlhad, waiting to begin the second stage of the assault upon Dol Guldur. You have participated in the skirmish at the gate of the fortress and should speak now with Goldagnir to learn his plans for the next stage of the battle.\n4\tComplete Skirmish: Assault on the Ringwraiths' Lair\tThe battle for Dol Guldur continues, with the next skirmish taking place behind the walls of the city. This quest involves a Skirmish that can be completed at Solo, Duo, Small Fellowship, Fellowship, or Raid group sizes by using the Skirmish Join Panel. This Skirmish has a minimum level of 60.\n5\tTalk to Goldagnir at Thangúlhad\tGoldagnir is in Thangúlhad. You have participated in the second skirmish at Dol Guldur and should report to Goldagnir.\n6\tTalk to Ningloril at Thangúlhad\tNingloril is in Thangúlhad, the camp of the Golden Host in Gathbúrz. Ningloril has asked for you to come see her again about a secret errand.\n",
[2974]="7006F39A\n1\tTalk to Asharmûl in south-east Ahâba\tAsharmûl is in south-east Ahâba.\n2\tTalk to Asharmûl and go with Têrkar's Travellers into Emax Dûl\tThe time has come for you to go with Asharmûl and the rest of Têrkar's Travellers into the guarded fastness of Emax Dûl.\n3\tTalk to Inkanûsh on the island in the centre of the oasis of Ahâba\tInkanûsh must be told what you have discovered.\n",
[2975]="7006F39B\n1\tTalk to Glorfindel in Ahâba\030Talk to Ulishár in Ahâba\tYour companions assemble in Ahâba to discuss these fresh dangers.\n2\tTalk to Rahâzi in Ahâba\tYour companions assemble in Ahâba to discuss these fresh dangers.\n3\tReturn to Khanâg Valoyar in An Shêru\tAccording to what you learned in Emax Dûl, supply-waggons for Sûg Nidar depart from Khanâg Valoyar, south of Jiret-menêsh, in An Shêru.\n4\tTalk to Rahâzi in Khanâg Valoyar\tRahâzi is at Khanâg Valoyar in An Shêru.\n5\tTalk to Rahâzi in Khanâg Valoyar and sneak aboard the next waggon to depart\tRahâzi is at Khanâg Valoyar, in An Shêru. She has identified the next waggon to depart, and is prepared to sneak aboard it with you.\n6\tTalk to Rahâzi outside the waggon that brought you to Sûg Nidar\tYou can return to the Fearwater by using the banner at Khanâg Valoyar, in An Shêru. Rahâzi is outside the waggon that brought the two of you to Sûg Nidar, the Fearwater.\n",
[2976]="7006F2CF\n1\tTalk to Shenzâmin at Gadim-ûn\tRahâzi has introduced you to the Hamâti soldiers with whom she travels. They can be found at Gadim-ûn in An Shêru.\n2\tTalk to Kishâtal at Gadim-ûn\tRahâzi has introduced you to the Hamâti soldiers with whom she travels. They can be found at Gadim-ûn in An Shêru.\n3\tTalk to Mashdagâl in Gadim-ûn\tIt would appear Mashdagâl has something he wants to say.\n4\tFind Naxar Dâl to the north of Gadim-ûn\tMashdagâl told you that if you want to help so badly, you might deal with creatures of evil at Naxar Dâl.\n5\tDefeat wights at Naxar Dâl ([see journal]/6)\tWights stalk Naxar Dâl in northern An Shêru.\n6\tDefeat wights at Naxar Dâl (5/6)\tWights stalk Naxar Dâl in northern An Shêru.\n7\tTalk to Shenzâmin in Naxar Dâl\tShenzâmin is in Naxar Dâl. What has he discovered?\n8\tExamine the corpse of the sorcerer of Ordâkh in Naxar Dâl\tShenzâmin discovered the corpse of a man of Ordâkh wearing sorcerous robes in Naxar Dâl.\n9\tRead the parchment you recovered from the sorcerer of Ordâkh\tYou picked up a parchment covered in a sorcerer's mad ravings.\n10\tBring the parchment you found to Glorfindel in Gadim-ûn\tGlorfindel will want to see the writings of the sorcerer of Ordâkh. The Elf-lord waits for you in Gadim-ûn.\n",
})
